{"title":"Career roadmap · Content Strategist","role":"Content Strategist","summary":"A Content Strategist plans how an organisation uses content to attract, educate, engage and convert its target audience. The role combines content research, audience understanding, SEO, storytelling, editorial planning, analytics, brand strategy and increasingly AI-assisted content workflows.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Digital Marketing"},"about":[{"label":"Core combination","text":"Marketing + content + SEO + analytics + storytelling"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA in Digital Marketing, this is a strong direct alignment."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Digital Marketing","Content/Digital Marketing Internship","Content Executive / Content Strategist Associate","Content Strategist","Senior Content Strategist","Content Lead / Content Marketing Manager","Head of Content"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build copywriting, SEO, content planning, social media, analytics and digital-marketing skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in SEO/content, B2B, product content, brand storytelling or growth content"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Content Strategist, Content Lead or Content Marketing Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Head of Content, Content Strategy Director, Brand Strategy or independent consulting"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Writing + marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Marketing, communication, consumer